  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Volume of parallelopiped <math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Here,&nbsp;the parallelopiped is formed by the vectors&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math><mi>a</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;<br />So, the volume,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi></math>&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;cubic units</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;the volume of the parallelopiped is minimum when&nbsp;<math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
